# Build output and generated files — never commit secrets or binaries.
# design.md is intentionally kept out of the repo (internal design notes).
# NOTE: receiver/public/payload.exe IS committed on purpose — it is the
# dropper's download target; the PSK inside is XOR-masked by build.py.
design.md
keylogger/config.json
keylogger/src/gen_strings.h
keylogger/res/generated.rc
keylogger/res/version_res.o
keylogger/out/
receiver/node_modules/
receiver/.next/
receiver/.env.local
receiver/next-env.d.ts
tests/keylogger/*.exe
.vercel-logs-token.txt
.vercel/
__pycache__/
